# Research source documents — copyrighted; preserve locally, do NOT distribute
# (Gold-Set "preserve, don't push" policy). Anchored to where the corpus actually
# lives; the earlier research/papers/**/*.pdf was mis-anchored to the repo root and
# never matched the docs/development/research/ tree, so 122 PDFs + 1 epub stayed tracked.
docs/development/research/**/*.pdf
docs/development/research/**/*.epub
target/

